        "round": 1,
        "speaker": "烬",
        "portrait": "jin_serious",
        "text": "两个祷者。一起念，就是两道锁。别让封印同时落在一人身上——轮着扛。"
      },
      {
        "round": 3,
        "speaker": "苏言",
        "portrait": "suyan_smile",
        "text": "全体的一击，能同时打断两个人的祷言。记住：雨落下来，火才会熄。"
      }
    ],
    "victory": "btl_b6_result",
    "exp_reward": 70,
    "bg": "assets/placeholder/backgrounds/bg_throne_1.png"
